.TH UNIPASTE 1 unipaste\-VERSION
.SH NAME
unipaste \- convert HTML and rich clipboard data to plain text and markdown
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B unipaste
.RB [ \-urvKh ]
.RB [ \-m
.IR mode ]
.RB [ \-t
.IR table ]
.RB [ \-l
.IR link ]
.RI [ file\ ... ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B unipaste
reads rich text, HTML fragments, or TSV data from standard input or files and converts them
into formatted plain text, Markdown, Slack/Discord mrkdwn, Jira markup, or terminal output. It formats tables,
nested lists, code blocks, math formulas ($LaTeX$), and links for plain-text editors and terminals.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-m " mode"
Output mode:
.RS
.TP
.B plain
Formatted plain text (default).
.TP
.B markdown
GitHub-Flavored Markdown.
.TP
.B slack
Slack and Discord mrkdwn dialect (tables in code blocks, <url|text> links).
.TP
.B jira
Jira and Confluence wiki markup (|| headers ||, {code}, [text|url]).
.TP
.B terminal
ANSI terminal escape sequences (bold headings, italic text).
.RE
.TP
.BI \-t " table"
Table format:
.RS
.TP
.B grid
ASCII box borders (+---+---+).
.TP
.B markdown
Markdown pipe table (| a | b |).
.TP
.B tsv
Tab-separated values.
.TP
.B simple
Space-aligned columns.
.RE
.TP
.BI \-l " link"
Link format:
.RS
.TP
.B bracket
"text (url)" (default for plain mode).
.TP
.B inline
"[text](url)" (default for markdown mode).
.TP
.B text
Keep anchor text only, strip URLs.
.TP
.B footnote
Emit numbered references "[1]" and list footnotes at the bottom.
.RE
.TP
.B \-K
Keep URL tracking and telemetry parameters (stripping enabled by default).
.TP
.B \-u
Use UTF-8 Unicode box-drawing characters for tables.
.TP
.B \-r
Emit Windows CRLF (\\r\\n) line endings.
.TP
.B \-v
Print version information and exit.
.TP
.B \-h
Print help message and exit.
.SH EXAMPLES
Convert clipboard HTML on X11:
.PP
.nf
.RS
xclip -selection clipboard -t text/html -o | unipaste
.RE
.fi
.PP
Convert HTML file to Markdown:
.PP
.nf
.RS
unipaste -m markdown input.html > output.md
.RE
.fi
.PP
Render tables with Unicode borders:
.PP
.nf
.RS
unipaste -u input.html
.RE
.fi
